erence Candidate A.\n\nWe must note uncertainties: lack of explicit calmness under pressure for A, unknown memory issues, unknown teamwork dynamics beyond show-off. Also need more info about B's calmness, D's temperament, C's communication.\n\nThus we state provisional preference Candidate A, confidence maybe 55%.\n\nNow produce output."}
